      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>A hag-crafted town guard of Coven Cove, answering to Captain Barra Coldvein and the Tide-Court. Tideguard operate in fours with a sergeant: a police action, not a warband. They grapple, interpose, harpoon ankles, and drag offenders off the seam. Four of them is a Medium encounter the party cannot win socially, even by winning.</p>",
